Intel Expands AI Portfolio Across Data Centers And PCs

At Hot Chips 2026, Intel is highlighting three products aimed at different parts of the AI market: 

1. Diamond Rapids for large enterprise workloads;
2. Crescent Island for running AI models in data centers;
